      "body": "### Problem:\r\nThe multi-turn rollout documentation contained incorrect parameter names that didn't match the actual implementation, causing confusion for users trying to configure tools and interactions.\r\n\r\n**Changes:**\r\n\r\nTool Configuration\r\n\r\n❌ Before (incorrect): `actor_rollout_ref.rollout.tool_kwargs.tools_config_file`\r\n✅ After (correct):  `actor_rollout_ref.rollout.multi_turn.tool_config_path`\r\n\r\n❌ Before (incorrect): `actor_rollout_ref.rollout.interaction_config_file`\r\n✅ After (correct): `actor_rollout_ref.rollout.multi_turn.interaction_config_path`\r\n\r\n\r\nAll working examples, tests, and recipe files throughout the codebase use the correct parameter names:",
