            "body": "## Code Review\n\nThis pull request addresses a documentation bug where incorrect parameter names were used for multi-turn configuration. The changes in `docs/sglang_multiturn/multiturn.rst` correctly update `tools_config_file` to `tool_config_path` and `interaction_config_file` to `interaction_config_path`, and places them under the `multi_turn` key. These changes align the documentation with the actual implementation as seen in `verl/trainer/config/rollout/rollout.yaml` and `verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/sglang_rollout.py`. The fix is accurate and improves the clarity of the documentation for users configuring multi-turn rollouts. The changes are correct and I have no further feedback.",
